---
slug: "fragments/about.html"
layout: null
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="about-page about-style-ref">
  <div class="about-container">
    <header class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-left">
        <h1 class="about-title">{% if zh %}廖先皓(Harry){% else %}Xian-Hao (Harry) Liao{% endif %}</h1>
        <p class="about-sub">{% if zh %}Harry 是跨領域多媒體設計師，擅長視覺、UX、互動與動態。2024 年取得 MassArt DMI MFA，專注多媒體設計與交互設計。{% else %}Harry is a multimedia designer with experience across visual design, UX, interactive media,
          and motion. He earned his MFA from MassArt's DMI in 2024 and focuses on multidisciplinary media and
          experiential design.{% endif %}</p>
        {% if zh %}<a class="btn resume-btn" href="/upload/%E5%BB%96%E5%85%88%E7%9A%93_%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E7%B0%A1%E6%AD%B7.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">履歷下載{% else %}<a class="btn resume-btn" href="/upload/Resume_Xian-Hao_Harry_Liao.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resume Link{% endif %}</a>
      </div>

      <div class="about-right">
        <div class="portrait-frame">
          <img src="/images/xianhaoliao.webp" alt="Xian-Hao (Harry) Liao Portrait" class="about-portrait" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="skill-row">
      <div class="skill-block">
        <h3>{% if zh %}設計工具{% else %}Visual Design{% endif %}</h3>
        <p>Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, Premiere, After Effects, Cinema 4D, Blender, Figma.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-block">
        <h3>{% if zh %}數位能力{% else %}Digital Experience{% endif %}</h3>
        <p>HTML / CSS / JS, React, Bootstrap, Python, CMS, Google Analytics.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="moments">
      <h2 class="moments-title">{% if zh %}Harry 的亮點{% else %}See Harry's Moments{% endif %}</h2>
      <div class="moments-row">
        <article class="moment-card">
          <img src="/images/About/Meet.webp" alt="Harry Liao at Fresh Media Exhibition">
          <h4>Fresh Media</h4>
          <p>{% if zh %}DMI 學生策展展{% else %}DMI Students Led Exhibition{% endif %}</p>
        </article>
        <article class="moment-card">
          <img src="/images/About/Meet%202.webp" alt="Harry Liao participating in Human 2.0 MIT Media Lab Training">
          <h4>Human 2.0</h4>
          <p>{% if zh %}MIT Media Lab 訓練{% else %}MIT Media Lab Training{% endif %}</p>
        </article>
        <article class="moment-card">
          <img src="/images/About/Meet%203.webp" alt="Harry Liao receiving Master's Degree from MassArt DMI">
          <h4>Master's Degree</h4>
          <p>{% if zh %}MassArt MFA 2024{% else %}MassArt MFA: DMI 2024{% endif %}</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="thesis-cta">
      <div class="thesis-card">

        <div class="thesis-text">
          <h3>{% if zh %}論文書{% else %}Check out Harry's thesis book{% endif %}</h3>
          <p>{% if zh %}《Dream Reality》：探索夢境與夢的視覺表現。{% else %}Dream Reality — a master's thesis exploring dreaming and the artistic presentation of dreams.{% endif %}</p>
          <a class="btn thesis-btn" href="https://dynamicmediainstitute.org/wp-content/uploads/Xian-Hao-Harry-Liao_Dream-Reality_Thesis-Book-compressed.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{% if zh %}論文書 PDF{% else %}THESIS BOOK PDF{% endif %}</a>
        </div>
        <div class="thesis-image">
          <img src="/images/TB.webp" alt="Dream Reality MFA Thesis Book Preview by Harry Liao">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="projects-invite">
      <div class="invite-inner">
        <div class="invite-media">
          <img src="/images/About/Welcome.webp" alt="Harry Liao's portfolio work preview strip">
        </div>
        <div class="invite-cta">
          <h3>{% if zh %}邀請您查看Harry的作品集PDF{% else %}Learn more about Harry's work!{% endif %}</h3>
          <p>{% if zh %}裡面收集了所有Harry的作品。{% else %} Link to Harry's portfolio pdf. {% endif %}</p>
          <a class="btn primary" href="/upload/Portfolio_Harry.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{% if zh %}另外開啟PDF{% else %}View
            PDF{% endif %}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="learn-more-section">
      <div class="learn-more-inner">
        <h2 class="learn-more-title">{% if zh %}看看 廖先皓 Harry線上作品{% else %}View Harry's Online Work{% endif %}</h2>
        <a href="{{ L }}/#work" class="learn-more-btn" data-spa-target="work">
          <span>{% if zh %}前往作品頁面{% else %}Click Here{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
